Package: rtmodesign
Type: Package
Title: Regularized Third-Order Moment Optimal Designs for Active-Controlled Dose-Response Studies
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("haohaostats", email = "haocstats@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides an application-oriented workflow for planning
    active-controlled dose-response studies using regularized third-order
    moment optimal designs. The public interface accepts patient-level pilot
    data and clinical design conditions, estimates the target-dose problem,
    constructs approximate and exact allocations, and returns a structured
    design object with transparent regularization and optimality diagnostics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/rtmodesign
